[Host] Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

68
00:08:59,375 --> 00:09:07,895
[Slow] 18日、長期金利は一時、何パーセントまで上がりましたか。

69
00:09:08,696 --> 00:09:13,567
[Host] Two point nine four five percent — the highest in about thirty years.

70
